        "id": 1561214
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-29T22:21:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What I\u0027m not clear about it is that, before returning to userspace, if the activity manager service wants to start another process of this app, what will happen?",
      "parentUuid": "feb44009_de73d09e",
      "revId": "c24b094ead69bfe8ca01c38f602fba9d2ed97077",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
